{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 ZP Master Pro\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Processore di mastering integrato con Tape Glue, Compressore Glue Matrix, Tone Guard dinamico, Limiter lookahead brickwall, metering broadcast LUFS/LRA/True-Peak e Auto dB Target.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Integrated master processor featuring Tape Glue, Glue Matrix compressor, dynamic Tone Guard, brickwall lookahead limiter, broadcast LUFS/LRA/True-Peak metering, and Auto dB Target leveling.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Sviluppata su un'idea di Paolo Balestri \u183 ? Lato Cardioide (latocardioide.it) Guida completa: ZP Studio Suite/help/index.html#plugin-master-pro\par}
}

