{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 ZP Loudness Meter Multichannel\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Loudness e channel meter multicanale professionale per controllo rapido in produzione, doppiaggio, voiceover, broadcast e mastering (LUFS-I, LUFS-S, LUFS-M, LRA, True Peak e RMS-M).\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Professional multichannel loudness and peak meter for production, broadcast, voiceover, and mastering (LUFS-I, LUFS-S, LUFS-M, LRA, True Peak, and RMS-M up to 64 channels).\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Sviluppata su un'idea di Paolo Balestri \u183 ? Lato Cardioide (latocardioide.it) Guida completa: ZP Studio Suite/help/index.html#plugin-loudness-meter\par}
}

