{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 ZP Voice-Music Probe\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Sonda telemetrica passiva per bus voce e musica su memoria condivisa gmem (ZP Shared Bus): misura RMS, picco, crest factor, densita', brillantezza e speech activity senza toccare l'audio o la latenza.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Passive telemetry probe for voice and music buses using gmem shared memory (ZP Shared Bus): tracks RMS, peak, crest factor, density, brightness, and speech activity with zero latency and no audio alteration.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Sviluppata su un'idea di Paolo Balestri \u183 ? Lato Cardioide (latocardioide.it) Guida completa: ZP Studio Suite/help/index.html#plugin-probe\par}
}

