{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Automixer per dialoghi a due voci per broadcast, podcast e doppiaggio. Dominance Engine intelligente con modalit\u224 ? Delta o Absolute, controllo Background, lookahead a latenza zero o compensata e monitor fail-safe.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Sviluppata su un'idea di Paolo Balestri \u183 ? Lato Cardioide (latocardioide.it) Guida completa: https://latocardioide.it/strumenti/ o dal pulsante '?'\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Dual-mic dialogue automixer for broadcast, podcast and dubbing. Intelligent Dominance Engine with Delta and Absolute modes, Background ducking control, lookahead and fail-safe monitoring.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Developed from an idea by Paolo Balestri \u183 ? Lato Cardioide (latocardioide.it) Complete documentation: https://latocardioide.it/strumenti/ or click '?'\par}
}

